explain select id, status from docs where match(body) against('fox') order by category;
➤ TP QUERY PLAN[12,0,0]  𝄀
Project  𝄀
  ->  Sort  𝄀
        Sort Key: docs.category INTERNAL  𝄀
        ->  Sort  𝄀
              Sort Key: mo_fulltext_alias_0.__mo_ft_score DESC  𝄀
              ->  Join  𝄀
                    Join Type: INNER  𝄀
                    Join Cond: (docs.id = mo_fulltext_alias_0.__mo_ft_doc_id)  𝄀
                    Runtime Filter Build: #[-1,0]  𝄀
                    ->  Table Scan on fulltext2_covered.docs  𝄀
                          Runtime Filter Probe: docs.id  𝄀
                    ->  Table Function on fulltext2_search
select id, status, category from docs where match(body) against('fox') order by category, id;
